# 🛍️ SEO SNIPPETS - VALMIIT LIQUID-PALASET

## 1️⃣ **BreadcrumbList Snippet** - snippets/breadcrumb-list.liquid

```liquid
{% comment %}
  BreadcrumbList Schema.org snippet
  Käyttö: {% render 'breadcrumb-list', collection: collection, current_tags: current_tags %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- assign crumbs = '' -%}
{%- capture crumbs -%}
[
  {"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"{{ shop.url }}"}
  {%- if collection -%}
  ,{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"{{ collection.title | escape }}","item":"{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}"}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if current_tags.size > 0 -%}
  ,{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"{{ current_tags | join: ', ' | escape }}","item":"{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}"}
  {%- endif -%}
]
{%- endcapture -%}

<script type="application/ld+json">
{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":{{ crumbs }}}
</script>
```

## 2️⃣ **Canonical & Noindex Snippet** - snippets/canonical-noindex.liquid

```liquid
{% comment %}
  Canonical & Noindex snippet
  Käyttö: {% render 'canonical-noindex', collection: collection, current_tags: current_tags %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- if current_tags.size > 0 -%}
  <link rel="canonical" href="{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}">
  {%- if current_tags.size > 1 -%}
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow">
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
```

## 3️⃣ **Hreflang Snippet** - snippets/hreflang.liquid

```liquid
{% comment %}
  Hreflang snippet
  Käyttö: {% render 'hreflang', collection: collection %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- assign base_url = collection.url | default: '' -%}
<link rel="alternate" hreflang="fi" href="{{ shop.locale_urls.fi }}{{ base_url }}">
<link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="{{ shop.locale_urls.en }}{{ base_url }}">
<link rel="alternate" hreflang="ru" href="{{ shop.locale_urls.ru }}{{ base_url }}">
<link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="{{ shop.url }}{{ base_url }}">
```

## 4️⃣ **GA4 Filter Events Snippet** - snippets/ga4-filter-events.liquid

```liquid
{% comment %}
  GA4 Filter Events snippet
  Käyttö: {% render 'ga4-filter-events', tag: tag, collection: collection %}
{% endcomment %}

<a href="{{ tag | link_to_tag: tag }}" 
   data-tag="{{ tag }}"
   onclick="window.gtag && gtag('event','filter_click',{filter:this.dataset.tag,collection:'{{ collection.handle }}'})">
  {{ tag }}
</a>
```

## 5️⃣ **FAQ Schema Snippet** - snippets/faq-schema.liquid

```liquid
{% comment %}
  FAQ Schema snippet
  Käyttö: {% render 'faq-schema', faq_items: faq_items %}
{% endcomment %}

{% assign lang = localization.language.iso_code | downcase %}

{% capture faq_json %}
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {% for item in faq_items %}
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "{{ item.question | escape }}",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "{{ item.answer | escape }}"
        }
      }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
    {% endfor %}
  ]
}
{% endcapture %}

<script type="application/ld+json">
{{ faq_json | strip }}
</script>
```

## 6️⃣ **LCP Optimization Snippet** - snippets/lcp-optimization.liquid

```liquid
{% comment %}
  LCP Optimization snippet
  Käyttö: {% render 'lcp-optimization', image_url: 'hero.jpg', width: 1200, height: 700 %}
{% endcomment %}

<link rel="preload" as="image" href="{{ image_url | asset_url }}" imagesrcset="{{ image_url | image_url: width:width }} {{ width }}w" imagesizes="100vw">
<img src="{{ image_url | asset_url }}" width="{{ width }}" height="{{ height }}" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" alt="{{ alt | default: 'HerbSpot' }}">
```

## 7️⃣ **Complete SEO Head Snippet** - snippets/seo-head.liquid

```liquid
{% comment %}
  Complete SEO Head snippet
  Käyttö: {% render 'seo-head', collection: collection, current_tags: current_tags %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- assign og_locale = localization.language.iso_code | downcase -%}
{%- if og_locale == 'en' -%}{%- assign og_locale = 'en_US' -%}{%- endif -%}

<!-- Canonical & Noindex -->
{% render 'canonical-noindex', collection: collection, current_tags: current_tags %}

<!-- Hreflang -->
{% render 'hreflang', collection: collection %}

<!-- OG Locale -->
<meta property="og:locale" content="{{ og_locale }}" />

<!-- BreadcrumbList -->
{% render 'breadcrumb-list', collection: collection, current_tags: current_tags %}
```

## 8️⃣ **Collection Template Usage** - collection.liquid

```liquid
{% comment %}
  Collection template with SEO snippets
{% endcomment %}

{% render 'seo-head', collection: collection, current_tags: current_tags %}

<!-- Collection Filters -->
<nav class="collection-filters" aria-label="Filters">
  <ul>
    {% for tag in collection.all_tags %}
      <li>
        {% render 'ga4-filter-events', tag: tag, collection: collection %}
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</nav>

<!-- Product Grid -->
{% paginate collection.products by 24 %}
  <div class="product-grid">
    {% for product in collection.products %}
      {% include 'product-card', product: product %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {{ paginate | default_pagination }}
{% endpaginate %}
```

## 9️⃣ **Theme.liquid Usage** - theme.liquid <head>

```liquid
<!-- SEO Head -->
{% render 'seo-head', collection: collection, current_tags: current_tags %}

<!-- LCP Optimization -->
{% render 'lcp-optimization', image_url: 'hero.jpg', width: 1200, height: 700 %}

<!-- FAQ Schema (only on FAQ page) -->
{%- if template.name == 'page' and page.handle == 'faq' -%}
  {% render 'faq-schema', faq_items: faq_items %}
{%- endif -%}
```

